mpany is the largest provider of supplemental insurance in the U.S. and is best known for its payroll deduction coverage."}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2020, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2020, "rank": 146, "itemDescription": "The supplemental health and life insurance provider is based in Columbus, Ga., and has a large business segment in Japan."}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2019, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2019, "rank": 143, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2018, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "best-companies", "title": "Fortune 100 Best Companies to Work For", "year": 2018, "rank": 85, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2018, "rank": 137, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2017, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "best-companies", "title": "Fortune 100 Best Companies to Work For", "year": 2017, "rank": 91, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2017, "rank": 483, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2017, "rank": 126, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "best-workplaces-millennials", "title": "100 Best Large Workplaces for Millennials", "year": 2017, "rank": 53, "itemDescription": "<em>Employees say:</em><br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\"One of the best things about this company is the culture of honesty and transparency. If things are trending badly, we know about it and we know the plans that are in place to correct course. Everyone buys into the plan and executes together, as a team. When things are going great, we celebrate wins as a team. It's a great atmosphere\u2014a competitive, winning atmosphere that I'm proud to be a part of.\"<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\"I feel that this is a great place to work mainly because this company gives me opportunities to make a difference while at work. I have gotten the opportunity to be part of the Aflac cancer committee and raise money for Aflac's cancer center in Atlanta. The trip to Atlanta was one of the most meaningful things I have done at work. It is nice to put in everyday work for a company that cares, and it is even better to get to directly contribute and be supported by management.\"<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n"}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2016, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "best-companies", "title": "Fortune 100 Best Companies to Work For", "year": 2016, "rank": 50, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2016, "rank": 135, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "best-workplaces-for-women", "title": "100 Best Large Workplaces for Women", "year": 2016, "rank": 72, "itemDescription": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>Employees say: </em></p><br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n<p class=\"p1\">\"Aflac actually makes exceptions to our processes based on specific situations. The work environment is friendly and flexible. There is always something to do. I can go to management if my situation is not being addressed as I feel it should. I am treated as an individual when needed. The teams function as a family. We all work together to support the Aflac brand!! We are family!\"</p><br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n<p class=\"p1\">\"[I appreciate] the encouragement of work/life balance,and that family and personal health is allowed to come first. Also, the ability of management to see their employees' skill sets and to develop them in the professional direction they would fit best, even if it means going outside their current department.\"</p><br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><em>Read the Great Place to Work review .</em></p>"}, {"slug": "best-workplaces-millennials", "title": "100 Best Large Workplaces for Millennials", "year": 2016, "rank": 49, "itemDescription": "\"I love how management is very approachable and attentive to what suggestions you may have. They try to implement them as best they can. I love how the company gives incentives just for being an Aflac employee, such as getting movies tickets at a discount, having valet dry cleaning services, etc. I love how when you go the extra mile you are noticed for it. I just love feeling appreciated and valued. I love Aflac!\" says one millennial worker.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAccording to another millennial: \"Aflac is an amazing place to work. The culture here is like no other. Leadership truly cares about the people, and in turn the people take care of the business.\"<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>Read the .</em>"}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2015, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "best-companies", "title": "Fortune 100 Best Companies to Work For", "year": 2015, "rank": 49, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2015, "rank": 132, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "best-workplaces-millennials", "title": "100 Best Large Workplaces for Millennials", "year": 2015, "rank": 82, "itemDescription": "<p class=\"p1\">Occupying slot number 132 on the <i>Fortune</i> 500 list, Aflac spreads its wings far and wide as one of the nation\u2019s largest insurers. But that doesn\u2019t keep the company from feeling intimate. In addition to a \u201cspot awards\u201d program that recognizes outstanding employee achievements with instant cash, company stock and swag, the company holds a weeklong celebration for its staff every year. The event has included ice skating, mini-golfing, family outings, and more. That\u2019s not all\u2014those who volunteer at or help plan the affair also get invited to a party at CEO Dan Amos\u2019 country farm. As one worker gushes, \u201cWe are made to feel special and appreciated.\u201d <span style=\"color:#ff0000;\"><a style=\"color:#ff0000;\" href=\"http://us.greatrated.com/aflac-inc\" target=\"_blank\">Read the Great Place to Work review.</a></span></p>"}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2014, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "best-companies", "title": "Fortune 100 Best Companies to Work For", "year": 2014, "rank": 58, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2014, "rank": 496, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2014, "rank": 125, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2013, "rank": 462, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2013, "rank": 118, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2012, "rank": 497, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2012, "rank": 128, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2011, "rank": 473, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2011, "rank": 125, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2010, "rank": 469, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2010, "rank": 130, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2009, "rank": 152, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2008, "rank": 165, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2007, "r